          "id": 1946628,
          "username": "Daniel_Jude",
          "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/daniel_jude/{size}/417641_2.png",
          "created_at": "2026-11-21T06:27:47.981Z",
          "cooked": "<p>If you use Shopify Flow, this one from yesterday saves a lot of workarounds.</p>\n<p>The Product updated trigger already let you start a workflow when certain product fields changed. Now the same thing works for eight more: Customer updated, Order updated, Refund updated, Fulfillment order updated, Return updated, Collection updated, Location updated and Inventory item updated.</p>\n<p>You pick up to 5 fields to watch and the workflow runs when one of them changes. No more scheduled workflows checking every few hours.</p>\n<p>Some things it makes easy:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ping your fulfillment team when a customer changes the shipping address on an order</li>\n<li>react when products get added to or removed from a collection</li>\n<li>update a product metafield when an inventory item’s cost changes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Changelog:</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://changelog.shopify.com/posts/flow-new-updated-triggers-for-orders-customers-and-more\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://canada1.discourse-cdn.com/shopifyforum/original/4X/f/a/e/fae12cf8728f33affd4a3af6e4ee9daadc46f90a.png\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"99BD64\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://changelog.shopify.com/posts/flow-new-updated-triggers-for-orders-customers-and-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">changelog.shopify.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://changelog.shopify.com/posts/flow-new-updated-triggers-for-orders-customers-and-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Flow: New \"updated\" triggers for orders, customers, and more - Shopify Changelog</a></h3>\n\n  <p>You can now build workflows that respond when a customer, order, refund, return, fulfillment order, collection, location, or inventory item is upda...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Anyone already planning a workflow around one of these?</p>",
