      "summarized_text": "Shopify Flow has added “updated” triggers for eight more resource types: customers, orders, refunds, fulfillment orders, returns, collections, locations, and inventory items. Like the existing Product updated trigger, these let a workflow run when selected fields change; users can monitor up to five fields per trigger.\n\nThe change can replace scheduled workflows that periodically check for updates. Examples include alerting fulfillment staff when an order’s shipping address changes, responding when products enter or leave a collection, or updating a product metafield when an inventory item’s cost changes.\n\nThe post shares the Shopify changelog announcement and asks what workflows others might build. No replies or concrete plans are included, so the discussion has no reported decision or resolution yet.",
